<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Amic offers scrip dividend.</title>
<headline>Amic offers scrip dividend.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo American Industrial Corp Ltd said on Tuesday it would award capitalisation shares to ordinary shareholders registered on April 4.</p>
<p>Shareholders could elect to receive a final dividend of 385 cents per share in lieu of a capitalisation award.</p>
<p>Documentation dealing with the capitalisation award will be posted to shareholders on April 10.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
